window.products.push({"id":1101079,"name":"Veronese Design Mechanical Steampunk Astrolabe Star Tracker Wall Clock 17 Inch Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":151.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OWdTXonJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This intricately designed steampunk clock is packed with enough springs, gears, and fascinating mechanical details to keep you marveling and admiring it even as time flies by. As an astrolabe-inspired device, the clock will have you imagining you've stepped back into the study of a scientific craftsman. It's detailed with an antique bronze finish and includes hand-painted copper and brass details for an authentic antique metal look. Beautiful enough to use as a piece of wall art, it's sure to inspire a world of stories about tracking the stars and sky with its fascinating mechanical charm to figure out the time of day or night, but this astrolabe clock does all that for you with just 1 AA battery (not included)! Keep it for your own steampunk collection or give it as a gift to the steampunk fanatic in your life. 17.5 inch long x 17 inch high x 1 inch wide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OWdTXonJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veronese Design","source_asin":"B01NAWBRV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NAWBRV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NAWBRV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
