window.products.push({"id":1101098,"name":"6 Pcs Christmas Red and Black Buffalo Plaid Poinsettia Flowers with Red Jingle Bells Picks Christmas Tree Ornaments 11.2\" W for Rustic Christmas Tree ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816uLhdwPML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a Vintage Touch to Holiday Decoration. Glamorous in detail, crafted in mind, these artificial poinsettia picks embellished with a primitive plaid pattern on the petals, can enhance any Christmas decorative undertaking! They are perfect for: - Trimming your Christmas tree for a traditional holiday look. - Adding to the Christmas wreaths, garland and swag for striking focal point. - Placing in different floral bunches, serving as the star of bouquet or as a lovely accompaniment. - Placing the stems inside a vase with other artificial flowers to create a holiday centerpiece, or stand alone as an effortless and charming table arrangement. - Joining with bright spherical ornaments, tinsel, holly, and faux snow in clear glass bowls and vases. - Serving as photo shooting prop, photo scene setting or stage decoration. - Embellishing the gift basket and Christmas stocking to accent the holiday. Embellish Your Surroundings. As a classic holiday symbol, the popularity of poinsettias has spread quickly during the holiday season because of their vivacious tones. Add sweet accents to your surroundings, they are perfect for Christmas weddings, winter bridal showers, winter parties, New Year's celebration, special occasions, or simply use to brighten up a room during the holiday season. They can serve as excellent additions to your entertaining ambiance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816uLhdwPML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B08CXQLQGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CXQLQGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CXQLQGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
