window.products.push({"id":1101148,"name":"Amaste Blender, Blender for kitchen, 1200W High Power Hot and Cold Blender with Timer, Glass Countertop Smoothie Blender 64 OZ for Crushing Ice, Froze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-Oh7ovVlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL MACHINE, SIMPLIFY YOUR LIFE. Say goodbye to the mechanical buttons, the large touch panel helps you set more easily, precisely and quickly. With 9 pre-programmed settings, this professional 64 Oz countertop blender meets your versatile blending needs within5-20mins. CRUSHING THE TOUGHEST INGREDIENTS IN SECONDS. With 8 stainless steel high-speed sharp blades, this 1200w smoothie blender has the power to crush through whole fruits, frozen vegetables and so on in seconds. Up to 40000 RPM, with built-in Pulse and 8-speeds control. NOT ONLY BLENDER. This multifunctional cooking blender can make a lot of hot soups, creamy, baby food, shakes and smoothies. Perfect for family and commercial use. This kitchen blender can blend thick ingredients with tamper. The high performance blender is easy to clean which nothing would leak or splatter during blending. YOUR SAFETY IS GUARANTEED. Built-in timer, this juice blender would stop automatically according to your setting. The power-off function of the high speed blender will remind you to lock the lid.When the lid is open during blending, the power of the blender would shut until the lid is closed. WHAT YOU CAN GET? YOU ARE IN LUCK.1-Year warranty for a free replacement. 7/24 satisfy customer service. Package includes 64 oz Glass pitcher, main blender base, a tamper, cleaning brush, a cookbook & a manual guide. *Do not use dishwasher wash","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-Oh7ovVlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amaste","source_asin":"B07VSMYYVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VSMYYVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VSMYYVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
