window.products.push({"id":1101212,"name":"SMIRLY Charcuterie Boards Gift Set: Large Charcuterie Board Set, Bamboo Cheese Board Set - Unique Mothers Day Gifts for Mom - House Warming Gifts New ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jTcVHO+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Become a Great Host - Impress your guests with our large cheese board and charcuterie set. With a ton of beneficial features, our charcuterie tray and charcuterie board accessories make entertaining fun and easy. Our serving board is the largest on the market, so you'll have no trouble throwing an epic gathering with a colorful and tasty array of appetizing offerings. Our versatile board adds simplicity to your life and infinite ways to dazzle your guests. ✅Perfect for Any Gathering - Whether a romantic evening for two or a large holiday party, our meat and cheese board helps you create unforgettable memories and enjoy one of life's most rewarding experiences - time with friends and family. Our charcuterie platter features charcuterie boards with bowls, a cheese knife set, and all the charcuterie accessories you'll need for an evening filled with fun and festivities. ✅Stylish Housewarming Gift - Our charcuterie board and knife set are the perfect gifts for any modern couple, new homeowner, or apartment dweller. SMIRLY’s unique and beautiful board, with so many beneficial features and accompanying accessories, comes with a sturdy decorative box for instant gifting. Everyone on your list, no matter the occasion, will love and appreciate this thoughtful, functional, and timeless gift. ✅Unleash Your Creativity - Charcuterie boards are an art form. You can design a unique and gorgeous platter for any festivity. Consider our bamboo cheese board a blank canvas on which you are the master artist creating the perfect ensemble of meats, cheeses, veggies, crackers, fruits, and chutneys to please any audience. Our generously sized, 4-sided board with all the accessories and extras, lets you unleash your inner charcuterie artist! ✅Your Hosting Partner for Years - Our bamboo cheese board and knife set are a smart purchase for so many reasons. Bamboo is earth friendly, properly sourced, and highly renewable. It's nonporous and resists liquid so it won't bend, warp, crack, absorb odor, or stain. This hardwood is super easy to clean and very durable. A truly low maintenance wood that retains its natural aesthetic value for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jTcVHO+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMIRLY","source_asin":"B08P4D95Y2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4D95Y2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4D95Y2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
