window.products.push({"id":1101227,"name":"Fletchers' Mill Pump and Grind Table Top Stand, Perfect For Holding Two Pump & Grind Mills","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31-nSWf0LiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Minimalist design coupled with chrome makes the Pump & Grind stand an easy fit into any kitchen decor and will look great on most countertops and tables. It's designed to hold two Fletchers' Mill Pump & Grind mills (mills sold separately). Stand not only keeps mills ready at hand, it is also designed to keep mills off surfaces to prevent possible corrosion that can be caused by salt. Made of durable chrome plated steel. By Fletchers' Mill. Made by artisans in Maine, USA. Fletchers' Mill is a family owned company. For two generations, the Fletchers' family has owned and operated the finest mills and manufacturing facilities for crafting wood pepper mills, salt mills, muddlers and rolling pins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31-nSWf0LiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fletchers Mill","source_asin":"B00EAHU01I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EAHU01I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EAHU01I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1101228,"name":"Stingray 6 in 1 Kitchen Tool gadget","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ETC7p17dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT DESCRIPTION: The Stingray Kitchen Gadget is the only kitchen multi-tool available on the market that has this many (6) relevant functionalities combined in one product. Being able to mix these functionalities, without the need to change the tool in your hand, makes cooking even more enjoyable. Cook a whole meal without changing tools! The Stingray is a unique wanna-have in the kitchen but at the same time is a cost and space effective alternative to buying and storing all the tools separately. FUNCTIONALITIES: When you use the Stingray, you simply lift a hamburger with the spatula (1), flip a tuna steak with the tong (2), grab a sausage with the toothed tong (3), pierce a vegetable with the fork (4), and gently release it from the fork with the help of the 'launch control' (5). The launch control is activated by gently closing the Stingray when there is food on the fork. The spatula will gently push the food from the fork, preventing the food from being launched. When you put the Stingray on the countertop, the curved spatula makes sure that it will sit up (6) to prevent the countertop from getting dirty. All this can be done with one hand, leaving the other hand available to hold a plate or a drink. After you are done cooking, put it in the dishwasher to clean it, lock it and store it. SPECIFICATIONS: The Stingray is designed to be your helper while cooking in the pan in the kitchen (or while hiking/camping). For cooking over open fire or for barbecuing, we have the BBQ version (Stingray BBQ) on offer. The Stingray is made from stainless steel handles with a nylon front end that is heat resistant up to 240癈/460癋. Rubber pads are added to the handles to provide a better grip.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ETC7p17dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TNK","source_asin":"B06XG6RWVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XG6RWVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XG6RWVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
