window.products.push({"id":1101314,"name":"RIMOO Ultrasonic Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, 25dB Quiet Cool Mist Humidifier for Baby, Top Fill Humidifiers with One Knob Control, 3 Washable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s5u7qLRTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💧【Washable Tank of Ultrasonic Humidifier】Ultrasonic cool mist technology can quietly and safely moisten the air, which can better regulate air humidity, moisturize skin, reduce skin problems and relieve asthma. Patent washable tank design, with water and electricity separation technology, all parts in contact with water can be removed and cleaned, more clean and hygienic. 💧【4.5L Large Capacity】Holding up to 4.5L / 1.2 Gal water, cool mist humidifier allows for up to 24 hours of continuous use. With max mist output up to 280ml/h. The top fill cool mist humidifier provides two ways of water filling, either from the top water mist nozzle or directly from the water tank, easy to operate and avoid water dripping onto the desktop. Perfect ultrasonic humidifier for large rooms, bedrooms, baby nursery and office. 💧【One Knob Control of 3 Mist Levels & Timer】This humidifier is easy to operate with a rotary button to control the mist level (Low, Medium and High) and timer (1-9 Hours). Simply set the run time and mist level before going to bed or before work to effectively provide you with a comfortable environment. 360° mist nozzle: Easily direct the flow of mist away from areas that don't need moisture and toward the areas that do. 💧【Patented Silencing Design & Auto Shut-Off】Patented silencing design, below 25dB during operation allows you to sleep easily in a comfortable and quiet environment. Suspension atomization head design, always keep the atomization piece in the water surface under 4 ~ 5 mm of the best atomization depth, when the suspension atomization head detects no water, all spray modes will be automatically turned off. Ensure the safety of your use. 💧【Long Service Life & Excellent Service】The atomization head can be replaced and repaired, which can increase the service life without expensive replacement of the whole machine. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We promise to answer within 24 hours, we are willing to answer your questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s5u7qLRTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIMOO","source_asin":"B09M3KHSN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M3KHSN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M3KHSN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
