window.products.push({"id":1101316,"name":"Glass Straws Clear 9\" x 10 mm Drinking Straws Reusable Straws Healthy, Set of 10 with 3 Cleaning for Smoothie, Milkshakes, Bubble Tea,Reusable, Eco Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BhBkGZ7DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The straws are transparent, so it’s easy to see whether it’s clean or not. Easy to use and store. The glass straw made from 100% borosilicate glass, these will not cause any health problems.  Naturally clear, this borosilicate glass is shatter-resistant, making it both durable and safe to drink from.  Use them everyday in any drink. These straws are the perfect accompaniment to any drink throughout the day.  The borosilicate glass it has better heat resistance, suitable for hot drinks.  Glass straws are non-toxic and completely BPA free, so you can feel confident when drinking hot or cold liquids that no toxins are leaching into your beverage.  Simply rinse them out after every use, or place in the dishwasher, or use cleaning brush.  These brushes are long enough to clean the whole straw and can get rid of any accumulated stain or bacteria.  Very few people reuse plastic straws. Plastic is not biodegradable, meaning that it can harm the environment by leaching toxic chemicals into the water and soil. Glass straws are reusable, environmentally friendly, can be used for years. A great green gift - This set of handcrafted glass straws comes in a stylish box and makes a thoughtful present to anyone who is nvironmentally- conscious, or would simply appreciate a stylish addition to their kitchen. Dishwasher safe, scratch-free and stain-free, comes with 3 flexible cleaning brushes, making cleaning as easy as it can get. Specification: Metarial: borosilicate glass Length: 9 inches Outer Diameter: 2/5 inches (10mm) Package includes: 5x straight straws 5x bent straws 3x brushes Guaranteed for 100% satisfaction! If you are not 100% happy, return the straws for a full refund, no questions asked","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BhBkGZ7DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yashell","source_asin":"B07F33W6Z7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F33W6Z7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F33W6Z7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1101317,"name":"Finley Home Loring Entryway Storage Rack Hall Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616jW4Ji3nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"An easy way to clean up any entry way, the Loring Entryway Storage Rack Hall Tree has got storage and style you'll be happy to have around. Constructed with an intricate weaving pattern that almost wraps around the metal frame like a vine, this storage rack is durable and can withstand the daily wear-and-tear of people plunking down to remove their boots. Raised bottom storage keeps floors tidy by allowing space for shoes and boots, while the tough wooden bench is spacious enough to sit in comfortably. Three four-prong hooks are perfect for hanging coats, scarves, or hats. The top shelf is ideal for less frequently used items such as umbrellas and the low bottom shelf serves as a convenient place to plop your shoes after a long day. Keep everything you need to leave the house conveniently by the door.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616jW4Ji3nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Finely Home","source_asin":"B007FH8I8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007FH8I8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007FH8I8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
