window.products.push({"id":1101411,"name":"USB Desk Fan Small Table Fan, Portable Oscillation Desktop Fan 4 Speeds Adjustment, Rechargeable Battery Operated Mini Personal Fan, Quiet Office Fan ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cKNW13XTS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2021 UPGRADE ADJUSTABLE USB MINI DESK FAN : Our Usb desk fan upgrade to can be adjusted from left to right, up and down. keep you enjoy the cool wind at each angle. You just need to press \"S\" and it will automatically oscillate 120°left and right and you can according to your needs adjust the fan head up and down 90° 4-SPEED SILENT DESK FAN : The personal table fan has 4 wind speed levels (sleep mode/cool mode/strong mode/natural mode) You can adjust the wind speed according to your different heat dissipation needs. Our small table fan has a very small voice. when it is running, the lowest decibel is less than 20db and the highest decibel is 40db.very suitable for office and baby sleeping use. WIDELY COMPATIBLE/USB-POWERED :The mini desk fan with a USB cable, and there are two charging ports(Micro USB / Type-C ) so you can be used it with computers, laptops, power banks, wall chargers and any other USB-enabled power supply. The rechargeable battery fan provide up to 8.5 to 15 workings hours according the speed setting,because we upgraded its battery capacity of 4000mah. EASY CLEAN& CARRY : The oscillation desktop fan with removable front cover is easy to remove for cleaning the fan blade. Your can keep it always clean and modern. Our small table fan is only 6.5\" is convenient to carry, and is easy to use. The lightweight, powerful, cordless fan cools you down anytime, anywhere when you are office, bedroom, college dorm, camping,traveling home, kitchen, hotel etc. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE :Our factory has been established for 12 years, specializing in producing mini desk fans for sale.Our first online direct sale is to be able to receive more customer suggestions.We have a strong R&D department to make improvements according to customer needs. If you have any questions about our small table fan, please don't hesitate to let us know. We will provide you with professional answers and give you the best after-sales.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cKNW13XTS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCUBE","source_asin":"B08ZNDYHQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZNDYHQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZNDYHQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
