window.products.push({"id":1101442,"name":"Christmas Bundle; 15pc Handpicked Quality Crystals; Stones for Family Love and Harmony, Blocks Toxic personalities; Promotes Thankfulness, Peace, and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cECL3vfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celestite: 1 (2-3\") Blue Natural ClusterCitrine: 1 (3-4\") A-Quality Brazilian Cluster1 (1\") Natural Raw Piece: Apatite and Pyrite1 (1\") Tumbled Piece each: Blue Chalcedony, Turquoise, Carnelian, Aventurine, Botswana Agate, Dumortierite, Amazonite, Onyx, Amethyst, Rose Quartz, and Sodalite. Christmas is a time to come together with family, eat, drink, catch up, and while these moments may be lovely they sometimes include unpleasant ones. We can get nervous about introducing someone new to your family, having to answer the same question 100 times, we're thinking of money a little more than usual, that one relative we would prefer to avoid, and that relative we would wish were still with us. We have created a bundle to help you through the stressful times so you can get back to the good things! Celestite and Green Aventurine are calming and used for promoting a peaceful and stabilized atmosphere. Carnelian calms jealously. Citrine, Chalcedony, Dumortierite, and Iron Pyrite are energizing and help hold on to the positive. Citrine, specifically, can be used to workout family discord. Chalcedony promotes lightheartedness and Sodalite with over sensitivity and fear. Apatite and Amazonite promote openness and expression. Specifically, Amazonite dissolves social nervousness while Turquoise frees you of self-pity and facilitates new friendships. Botswana Agate and Rose Quartz can be used to develop self acceptance and encourage love. Onyx absorbs negativity. Amethyst and Amazonite can booth help with grief, coming to terms with the loss of a loved one and transitioning into a life without them. Amethyst balances mixed emotions, but excites as necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cECL3vfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07KFQYY5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KFQYY5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KFQYY5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
