window.products.push({"id":1101567,"name":"Sggvecsy 2 Pack St.Patrick's Day Gnome Plush Doll Green Irish Decorations Ireland Forever Leprechaun Hat Shamrock Gnome Scandinavian Swedish Tomte Nis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CZ0Zq8k5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE & SUITABLE SIZE: You will get 2 pieces of St. Patrick's Day gnomes with different designs. Due to transportation, the gnome hat is bend to fix the box. Inside the hat is adjustable iron wire, just expand the hat and adjust into original shape. The total height is approx 10.3inch, the width is approx 4.5inch,which is a proper size to fit any place. PREMIUM MATERIAL: These plush dolls are made of soft felt，knit fabric, wooden nose and fiber beard, which is durable and stable with soft comfortable touch, enables you to use several festival seasons. At the bottom of the gnome is filled with sand to make it standing steadily. SPECIAL DESIGN:We put classic St Patrick's Day elements-Shamrocks into the gnomes by color and design,we use the light and dark green color for the gnome and both of the them holding the flag of St Patrick’s day.As an old saying goes, gnome guards home and protect people from misfortune. It brings good luck to the family and is regarded as good luck. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE: The gnomes will bring you the good luck, warmth and happiness. The green clover conveys your blessing to the person you care about. Great gift for friends, family, neighbors and children. WIDELY APPLICATION: The handmade elf are adorable additions for you to decorate your home and room, like bookshelf, table, sofa, bed cabinets,bookcase, shelf and dining table. Children like the appearance mostly. Just enjoy your happy holiday with your family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CZ0Zq8k5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sggvecsy","source_asin":"B0BRMTMCZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRMTMCZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRMTMCZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1101568,"name":"Creative Linens Holiday Christmas Embroidered Poinsettia Tablecloth 70x90 & 8 Napkins Red Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610bQmQb42L._AC_SL1096_.jpg","description":"This is a gorgeous Christmas embroidered poinsettia Tablecloth. It has a red background with embroidered red poinsettia and holly scattered on it. All of the embroidery are outlined with gold thread. It also features heart-shaped die-cut cutwork border with gold embroidery. The napkin has an embroidered poinsettia outlined with gold thread at one corner. Imported. 100% polyester.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610bQmQb42L._AC_SL1096_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Linens","source_asin":"B00H5D52JE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H5D52JE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H5D52JE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1101569,"name":"Iittala Ultima Thule Old-Fashioned Glasses, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C3X7TG8SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A moment frozen in time. The iittala UT950030 Ultima Thule 6.8 oz. old fashion glass represents thousands of hours spent perfecting the glass blowing technique required to produce this bubble/crackle effect. The forms imitate nature and gradually change as the molten glass burns the surface of the wooden molds. This glass is part of an extensive collection of other pieces just like it. Perfect for your home. Ready for use at any table. Dishwasher safe. Only from iittala. Amazon.com Put a chill in the air with Iittala's Ultima Thule glassware. Glimmering with clear, textured surfaces, the organic collection evokes wintry water images like cascading icicles or a frost-covered window. This set of two old fashioned glasses feature thin, precision-cut rims and low-seated, slightly curved bodies. Crafted in a wood mold, each piece has its own special markings that come out in the glass-blowing process. At the base, bubbles of glass cluster as if they might drip right off. Three small round feet hold the vessel off the table-so the glass looks wet, but your table stays dry. Well-balanced and substantial to hold, these 6-3/4-ounce old-fashioned glasses make a handy addition to the bar and serve everyday beverages in the kitchen or dining room. They also go conveniently into the dishwasher. The classic Iittala design was created by Tapio Wirkkala in 1968 and named after the fabled arctic land. It is made in Finland. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C3X7TG8SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iittala","source_asin":"B0002XWDUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002XWDUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002XWDUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
