window.products.push({"id":1101577,"name":"Faux Fur Unstuffed Pouf Ottoman Cover Square Cream White | Fuzzy Storage Bean Bag Ottoman Pouf Foot Rest / Stool Cube | Floor Cushion Seat | Storage P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X4CBwuhpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For those customers who would like to cover your old existing poufs/ottomans, please be aware the folded size is 17.7\"L x 17.7\" Wx 13.8\"H and make sure your old pouf is smaller than this size The unstuffed ottoman could make your unused clothes, old pillows and plush toys into a soft foot rest and a home furniture It is also more affordable than stuffed ones Our new launched Faux fur ottoman cover positions 'SOFTNESS and COMFORTABLENESS' as we use the soft and smooth Faux Rabbit Fur material. Besides, it could make full use of your unused clothes, towels, blankets and other fabric by stuffing them inside as a home furniture besides a bean bag foot rest. Why us ? 1: Soft material.Soft and cozy Faux Rabbit Fur used as the pouf ottoman cube material 2: Affordable Price. 3: Animal Welfare. This faux fur illustrates our concern for animal welfare while allowing us to offer quality furs. 4: Customer Service. We aim to offer the best shopping experience. Product Specifications: Material: 100% Polyester Folded Size : 17.7\" x 17.7\" x 13.8\". COVER ONLY. Color: White Care Info: 1: No bleach 2: Cold Water How to Keep it Square Shape ? Usually it keeps the basic square shape after stuffing. But if you seek a perfect one, we recommend use CARDBOARD to hold the cube shape, then insert soft stuffings. Please be aware it is a pouf cover only WITHOUT FILLER and we have changed the Brand name to Aotea Crafts from Lux Picks due to our business growing, but with Lux Picks on the packaging as the brand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X4CBwuhpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aotea Crafts","source_asin":"B08V978P13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V978P13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V978P13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1101578,"name":"Vegetable Chopper Ding Xi Veggie Chopper12 in 1 Mandoline Slicer For Kitchen Multifunctional-Onion Chopper-Food Chopper Veggie Slicer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zempBG6RL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【High-Quality】: The vegetable chopper is made of high-quality BPA-free food-grade ABS plastic material, which is durable. For better performance, we use super sharp 420 grade hardened stainless steel blades to chop/dice tough vegetables. The heavy-duty stainless steel blade is sharp enough to cut through most types of vegetables and fruits. 【Multifunctional Mandoline】The food chopper contains 8 interchangeable blades, providing you with multiple ways of slicing, chopping, grinding. Food can also be cut into pieces and slices of varying thicknesses. The accessory has an egg white separator to easily separate egg whites from yolks. A functional vegetable chopper gift for cooking lovers. 【Save Time】It used to take a lot of time and effort to cut ingredients into small pieces and thin slices. The mandoline slicer for kitchen tool reduces the time-consuming of this process, so you won't have trouble chopping vegetables or fruits. Vegetable Chopper It makes it easier for you to add vegetables to your meals. Start now and enjoy more time with your family without missing out on any important nutrition. 【Easy To Use】Vegetable slicer easy to clean.No mess and no slips no - our catch tray makes cooking so much more convenient, and no messing around! It makes cleaning effortless and our non-slip base also makes your slicing and grating that much easier. 【Warm Reminder】 Do not place the blade arbitrarily. After rinsing and drying, please collect the blade in a container and keep it away from children. The blades are easy to remove for thorough cleaning, just use the claws and brush to scrape any residue off the platen and blade. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zempBG6RL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ding Xi","source_asin":"B08R8L65CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R8L65CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R8L65CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
