window.products.push({"id":1101596,"name":"IPOW Automatic Vacuum Sealer Machine with Kitchen Food Scale & LCD Display, Compact Food Sealer Starter Kit for Food Preservation Savers and Sous Vide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rQlGBXnLS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Built-In Digital Scale, Easy Food Preparing - Specially designed the vacuum sealer with 6.6lb digital scale built-in for the convenience of food preparation. It can switch 6 different units (oz ozt dwt ct g gn) to meet your different needs. LCD display for easy reading. (Tip: 2 X AAA Batteries that power supply only for food scale are not included,need to buy it by yourself and install before use the scale. Besides, to prevent the touch screen from insensitive when use, tear off the protective film before operation) Compact Body, Powerful Function - IPOW vacuum sealer has a small size with slim design, which won’t take up too much of your kitchen space. And the weight is not heavy and is flexible to place and use. With advanced air sealing technology and Lab tested quality, this Vacuum Sealer Machine provides 60kPa vacuum power and 8 times longer reservation time to meat, fruits, nuts, vegetables, snacks etc Practical Three Modes, Meets All Your Food Preservation Needs - Choose the Vacuum Seal setting for normal and solid food, the Control setting for poached, simmered or steamed food, control the degree of vacuum you want. Only Seal Mode allows you to seal the mouth without vacuuming, and can be used to preserve some snacks such as potato chips and biscuits. Sleek Looking, Simple Operation - Our vacuum sealer features silver smooth top panel and soft touch digital buttons along with LED indicator lights,which makes it easier to clean and operate. Now start using this device to equip and organize your freezer with fresh food instead of freezer burned food filled with ice crystals which will probably end up in the trash can. A Complete Bundle, Fully Starter Kit - Also comes with 10 vacuum bags, air pumping hose and cutter. The included vacuum hose makes this machine not only suitable for vacuum bag packaging, but also works with containers, jars, zipper bags and wine stopper. This is a complete bundle to make your cooking and meal preparation easier, keep food fresh longer, reduces food spoilage. Pay attention：The kitchen LCD scale requires additional batteries for normal operation，please install AAA batteries X2 before use Package includes: Vacuum machine,10 vacuum bags,usb cable, Instruction book. NOT includes: Vacuum scale tank, Batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rQlGBXnLS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPOW","source_asin":"B09CPNQSDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CPNQSDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CPNQSDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
