window.products.push({"id":1101743,"name":"HDCAXKJ Waterproof Leather Recliner Chair Covers 4-Pieces Recliner Slipcover Stretch Reclining Chair Cover Anti Slip Recliner Cover for Large Recliner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mkx8MWcoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Leather Fabric: Our recliner slipcover is made of high quality faux leather fabric which is high class and elegant, super soft, smooth and comfortable to touch, skin friendly and durable. The reclining couch covers is 100% waterproof, so it will effectively protect recliner from all kinds of accidentally water in daily life. The cover for recliner chair has fine workmanship, firm and uniform stitches, looks high-end and gorgeous, perfectly decorates your recliner 4-Pieces Design: This product includes 1 backrest cover, 1 seat cover and 2 armrest covers. Compared with regular 1-piece reclining chair cover, our separated design recliner slipcovers fit the recliner better, just like customized for your recliner. Our recliner couch cover are more non-slip. There are anti-slip straps that can be tied at the back to prevent recliner slip cover from shifting around. Highly recommended recliner covers for leather recliner or cloth recliner Super Stretch: The waterproof recliner cover slipcover fabric includes 5% spandex, so it's a highly stretchable elastic chair cover for recliner that you can stretch it up more to fit your recliner. This universal recliner sofa cover can easily fit most recliner chairs, suitable for recliners 24-33 inches wide. Great recliner covers for large recliner or small recliners. Please find the Measure Guide of our full coverage leather recliner chair cover in photos Premium Furniture Protector: Our leather recliner cover will freshen up your recliner in one second, also provides full protection for recliner from water, stains, wear and tear, cats scratching and dog hair. No need to worry about the recliner being wet, dirty or damaged. A must-have protective reclining sofa cover for living room, especially for homes with kids and pets. And there are holes on the arm covers which are prepared for recliner recessed lever or handles Easy Install & Easy Care: The recliner chair covers for reclining chair can be easily installed in 5 minutes, please find Installation Guide in photos. No washing needed! The fitted furniture covers for recliners is easy to care. Just clean it with a damp cloth when needed. Our belief is that quality speaks louder than anything! We provide 24*7 friendly customer support and also back our stretchy slipcover for recliner chair for 18 months, try it with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mkx8MWcoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HDCAXKJ","source_asin":"B0953D38ZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0953D38ZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0953D38ZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
