window.products.push({"id":1101749,"name":"AYQQE 2 Pack Reusable Grocery Bags,Extra Large Foldable Shopping Bag with zipper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RfAq0a2tL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Nylon lining Tie closure Machine Wash [2 SECOND FOLDING] -- Grab the two sides of the storage bag, pull it to the sides to return to flat, and then roll it up from one end and cover it with a tie to complete the fold. [EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY] -- 11” W x 11 H x 22” D Spacious enough to fit a large amount of grocery items while shopping at the grocery store or farmers market. [HEAVY DUTY] -- Strong yet lightweight construction easily supports 34 lbs. “X” stitches on the joint part make the long handles strong enough to hold many items without broken. [SPACE SAVING] -- When folded, grocery bag is only half the size of a phone, and at 113 grams it makes it easier to go out shopping. Easily placement in your seat back pocket, trunk or kitchen drawer. [REUSABLE BAG] -- The folding bag is washable. Keep our bag in your kitchen or trunk for convenience to help protect our environment and create a cleaner, more livable future.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RfAq0a2tL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYQQE","source_asin":"B0BFNQZ3SN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFNQZ3SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFNQZ3SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1101750,"name":"Pan Liners Versatile Microwave Oven Safe No Stuck-On Food Save Water Easy-to-Clean Great Puncture & Tear Strength 100 Count- Full Pan Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VnIeWRv7L._SL1001_.jpg","description":"Isn’t it a pain to scrub off stuck on food from the bottom of pans and pots? Not only is it a huge inconvenience, but it also leads to deterioration of your cooking utensils. To avoid this situation, you should always use pan liners – they are safe, reliable, and effective. Totally Safe Each sheet is made of BPA-free, non-toxic materials, and complies with FDA and USDA standards. One set contains 100 sheets. No Scrubbing You don’t have to waste, time excessively scrubbing or soaking pots and pans to remove baked or stuck-on food anymore! All you have to do is lift the pan liner and sanitize the utensil. Versatile Pan liners can withstand up to 400°F / 204°C, which makes them suitable for ovens, microwaves, and freezer storage. The sheets fit standard half pans with a depth of 4 inches. Ready 2 Cook High Temperature Pan Liners eliminate the need to scrub baked or stuck on food from pots and pans. Our pan liners are oven and microwave safe up to 400°F / 204°C. Pan Liners allow for increased productivity and efficiency in the kitchen, not to mention huge savings in both labor and water consumption. Stop Scrubbing! Save water, save time! Oven and microwave safe, maximum temperature 400°F / 204°C. Suitable for use in steam tables, and slow cookers. Suitable for freezer storage and freezer to oven cooking. After cooking, simply remove the pan liner and sanitize the pan. No more baked on foods. Better than foil! Pan liners resist punctures and tearing - serve directly from lined pan. Increase useful life of pots and pans Eliminates clogged drains - no grease and oil build up. Made In The USA BPA Free, contains no heavy metals. Meets FDA & USDA standards","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VnIeWRv7L._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ready2Cook","source_asin":"B01MR8RW69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MR8RW69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MR8RW69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
