window.products.push({"id":1101812,"name":"Portable Handheld Induction Sealer Bottle Cap Sealer for Cap Sizes 15mm -100mm 110 V from U.S. SOLID","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jWPl1+CyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Induction sealing, also known as \"cap sealing\", is a technique of airtight sealing a liner to the top of a plastic container by utilizing heat produced by an electromagnetic induction device. This method provides evidence of tampering or theft, prevents leaks, and preserves freshness! The U.S. SOLID Portable Handheld Induction Sealer Bottle Cap Sealer works by applying instant high heat to the foil that needs to be melted in order to seal the bottle. It seals the aluminum foil in a matter of seconds to seal plastic (and other non-metallic) bottles and preserve and protect whatever is stored inside. Other features of the cap sealer include an automatic counting function for quantity control, automatic power-off when left unused for more than 15 minutes, easy touch screen control, and its portable, light-weight design is perfect for industrial sealing in a limited space. It can seal bottles with various cap sizes from 15mm -100mm. Industries that could benefit from using our Portable Handheld Induction Sealer Bottle Cap Sealer included pharmaceutical, cosmetics, and pesticide. Specifications: BrandU.S. Solid SKU:JFPHIS00001 U.S. SOLID Model:USS-PHIS00001 GTIN-12 (U.P.C.)888107027867 Power Supply:AC 110 V, 60Hz Power Consumption:800 -1200W Static Current<0.1A Operating Frequency:30 KHz (±5%) Sealing Diameter:15 - 100mm Capacity:5-20 pcs/min Machine Size:19.3\" x 12.6\" x 5.3\" Weight:6.6 lbs. Notice If you want to seal glass bottles and jars, please note that special aluminum foil for glass must be used, not the kind used for plastic bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jWPl1+CyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U.S. Solid","source_asin":"B00KT2PFFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1101812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KT2PFFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KT2PFFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
